WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.440
Let's teach Grok who you are, one time.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.490
Look for the setting called Customize Grok.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.240
Paste in the note on this screen,

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.690
fill in your details, and save.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.504
Now Grok knows who you are in your chats.

